Description: Provides a tidy framework for landmark survival analysis,
    facilitating the construction of landmark-specific risk sets, 
    incorporation of longitudinal covariates, and estimation of associations 
    with time-to-event outcomes. Supports covariate estimation using last 
    observation carried forward (LOCF) or linear mixed-effects models (LME),
    alongside Cox proportional hazards and Fine-Gray competing risks regression. 
    Offers a consistent and reproducible workflow for conducting analyses across 
    multiple landmark times.
